   "caption": "Will home care take away their independence?\n\n4 myths about home care and independence:\n❌ Home care makes people lose their independence.\n❌ Aging in place is lonely and isolating.\n❌ People receiving home care can’t make their own decisions.\n❌ Home care means someone is in the house 24/7.\n\n✅ The reality: home care is a broad term that includes medical and non-medical care to support the independence of an individual.\n\nWant to talk it through? We are here to help!\nContact us for a free consultation at (608) 866-0697\nContact@royalpeoplecare.com\nVisit us at www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#homecare #homecaremyths #homecarereality #homecarerealities #royalcare #royalpeoplecare #royalpeoplecarellc"
