   "caption": "Home care is more than medical care.\n\nThere are 2 types of home care:\n🟣 Non-medical home care: support with daily living skills, like bathing, dressing, meal preparation, light housekeeping and companionship.\n⚪ Medical home care: support with chronic illness or conditions that need specialized expertise, from licensed professionals like RNs, LPNs and therapists.\n\nRoyal People Care provides non-medical in-home care.\n\nWe are here to help!\nContact us for a free consultation at (608) 866-0697\nContact@royalpeoplecare.com\nVisit us at www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#homecare #homecaremyths #homecarereality #homecarerealities #royalcare #royalpeoplecare #royalpeoplecarellc"
