   "caption": "Feeling lonely or isolated? 🧡\n\nLoneliness doesn’t always look like sadness. Sometimes it’s fewer calls, skipped outings, or more quiet days at home.\n\nSmall ways to stay connected: regular calls and visits, reading together, help getting the mail, hugs and words of encouragement.\n\nCompanionship is part of non-medical home care, and a caregiver can add friendly, steady company to the week.\n\nWe are here to help! Ask us about companion care.\nContact us for a free consultation at (608) 866-0697\nContact@royalpeoplecare.com\nVisit us at www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#caregiving #homecare #seniorcare #elderlycare #eldercare #royalcare #royalpeoplecare #royalpeoplecarellc #wecare #companioncare"
