   "caption": "Did you know? The economic value of unpaid caregiving is over $600 billion annually.\n\nA caregiver is someone who provides unpaid or paid care to individuals. The vast majority are family members or friends providing informal support at home.\n\nCaregiving can lead to lost wages, savings, and reduced work hours. It may also lead to physical and mental health issues.\n\nLet’s appreciate the work paid and unpaid caregivers do. Know a caregiver? Tag them to say thank you. 💜\n\nCaring for a loved one? We are here to help!\nContact us for a free consultation at (608) 866-0697\nContact@royalpeoplecare.com\nVisit us at www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#caregiving #homecare #mentalhealth #seniorcare #elderlycare #eldercare #royalcare #royalpeoplecare #royalpeoplecarellc #wecare"
