   "caption": "Is your parent’s home ready for a Wisconsin winter? ❄️\n\n4 simple things to check before the snow settles in:\n1. Clear the way in: plan who will shovel and salt the steps and walkway.\n2. Bright and warm inside: good lighting in entryways and hallways, extra blankets within reach.\n3. Stock up for snow days: easy, favorite foods in the pantry.\n4. Plan a storm check-in: agree on who calls or stops by when the weather turns.\n\nRoyal People Care’s homemaker services can help keep the home tidy and running smoothly all winter.\n\nSave this for your next visit, and call us with any questions:\n📞 (608) 866-0697\n✉️ Contact@royalpeoplecare.com\n🌐 www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#homecare #seniorcare #elderlycare #eldercare #royalpeoplecare #wecare"
