   "ct": "1 PM",
   "ng": "8 PM",
   "ngNextDay": false,
   "media": [
    "p/052/post.jpg"
   ],
   "caption": "Visiting a parent or grandparent soon? Try one of these conversation starters: 💬\n\n1. “What was your very first job?”\n2. “What song always takes you back?”\n3. “What did you do for fun at my age?”\n4. “Tell me about your favorite holiday.”\n5. “What advice would you give your younger self?”\n\nYou might hear a story you’ve never heard before.\n\nWhen you can’t visit as often as you’d like, Royal People Care’s companion care can add friendly conversation to their week.\n\nWhich question will you ask first? Tell us below 👇\n\n📞 (608) 866-0697\n✉️ Contact@royalpeoplecare.com\n🌐 www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#seniorcare #elderlycare #mentalhealth #caregiving #royalpeoplecare #wecare"
