   "caption": "This or that: morning coffee or afternoon tea? ☕🍵\n\nTell us how you take yours in the comments. Bonus points for the mug that goes with it!\n\nSharing a warm drink and a good conversation is one of our favorite parts of companion care at Royal People Care.\n\n📞 (608) 866-0697\n✉️ Contact@royalpeoplecare.com\n🌐 www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#seniorcare #elderlycare #homecare #royalcare #royalpeoplecare #wecare"
