   "caption": "Good care starts with what matters to the person. 💜\n\nWhen we plan personal care, we ask about:\n✔️ Their preferred pace and routines\n✔️ What they like to keep doing for themselves\n✔️ Privacy and comfort preferences\n✔️ Food they love and food they avoid\n\nBecause independence and dignity look different for everyone.\n\nPlanning care for a parent? Call us for a free consultation:\n📞 (608) 866-0697\n✉️ Contact@royalpeoplecare.com\n🌐 www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#homecare #seniorcare #elderlycare #eldercare #royalpeoplecare #wecare"
