   "caption": "3 small resets for busy caregiving days: 🌿\n\n1. Step outside for five minutes of fresh air.\n2. Write the to-do list down, then pick just one thing for today.\n3. Ask for one thing: when someone offers help, give them one clear task.\n\nSave this for the days you need it. 💜\n\nNeed a longer break? Royal People Care offers respite care.\n📞 (608) 866-0697\n✉️ Contact@royalpeoplecare.com\n🌐 www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#caregiving #mentalhealth #eldercare #homecare #royalpeoplecare #wecare"
