   "caption": "Adult Family Home FAQ: 3 quick answers 🏡\n\n1. What is it? A small, licensed, home-like setting in Mount Pleasant for up to 4 adults.\n2. Who is it for? Adults who need help with daily living, but don’t need full-time medical care.\n3. What help do residents get? Help with bathing, dressing, toileting and meals, plus general supervision and companionship.\n\nContact us to discuss payment options and verify eligibility.\n\nHave another question? Call us to ask about placement and next steps. Please keep personal and health details out of the comments.\n📞 (608) 866-0697\n✉️ Contact@royalpeoplecare.com\n🌐 www.royalpeoplecare.com\n\n#royalpeoplecare #royalcare #eldercare #seniorcare #caregiving #wecare"
